  "question": "Let $f(x)=\\tan^{-1}x$. Find $f'(x)$ and hence evaluate $f'(1)$.",
  "answeroption": "C",
  "explanation": "<b>Derivative of $\\tan^{-1}x$</b><br>$$f'(x)=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}$$<br><b>Evaluation at $x=1$</b><br>$$f'(1)=\\frac{1}{1+1^2}=\\frac{1}{2}$$<br>Hence, $$f'(1)=\\frac{1}{2}.$$",
